OL,3,GNEWSAPM challenged over Manchester to
OL,4,AWhitby train time
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has responded after Andy
OL,7,FBurnham was challenged to travel by
OL,8,Frail from Manchester to Whitby and
OL,9,Fback.
OL,11,FRaising the issue of poor rail and bus
OL,12,Flinks to the North Yorkshire coast, the
OL,13,Fchallenge was posed by Whitby
OL,14,Fcouncillor Phil Trumper last week.
OL,16,FAccording to online ticket firm
OL,17,FTrainline, the quickest train from
OL,18,FManchester to Whitby takes four hours
OL,19,Fand 19 minutes, with the return journey
OL,20,Ftaking four hours and 12 minutes. The
OL,21,Faverage round trip, however, takes
OL,22,Fcloser to 11 hours.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
